                <mxCell id="19" value="设计要点&lt;br&gt;1. 急停分 Manual / Auto 两条链（ManualEmergencyStop / AutoEmergencyStop）&lt;br&gt;2. 急停解除后按放权状态决定去向：放权→AutoStandby，未放权→ManualControl&lt;br&gt;3. 完成态/取消态只做短暂收尾发布（AutoDoneNear hold 3s，AutoDoneNormal 保持 1 个发布周期）&lt;br&gt;4. 收尾结束后按放权状态回落：放权→AutoStandby，未放权→ManualControl" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#90A4AE;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontFamily=Noto Sans JP;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="2050" y="170" width="500" height="165" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="20" value="终结态回落规则（均按放权状态分支）&lt;br&gt;AutoDoneNormal --[decentralization]--&gt; AutoStandby / --[!decentralization]--&gt; ManualControl&lt;br&gt;AutoDoneNear --[hold 3s + decentralization]--&gt; AutoStandby / --[!decentralization]--&gt; ManualControl&lt;br&gt;AutoCancelTakeover --[TakeoverCancelTimeout &gt;303s]--&gt; ManualControl&lt;br&gt;AutoCancelNewTask --[count==0 + decentralization]--&gt; AutoStandby / --[!decentralization]--&gt; ManualControl&lt;br&gt;AutoDoneEstopNear --[is_estop]--&gt; AutoEmergencyStop / --[decentralization]--&gt; AutoStandby / --[!decentralization]--&gt; ManualControl" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#90A4AE;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontFamily=Noto Sans JP;" parent="1" vertex="1">
