                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="21" value="AutoEmergencyStop 恢复逻辑（当前实现）&lt;br&gt;1. EmergencyCleared + decentralization -&gt; AutoStandby&lt;br&gt;2. EmergencyCleared + !decentralization -&gt; ManualControl&lt;br&gt;注：当前代码未实现 last_auto_substate 记忆恢复，急停解除后需 Autoware 重新发 DRIVING 才能恢复执行" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#43A047;fillColor=#F6FFF6;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontFamily=Noto Sans JP;" parent="1" vertex="1">
